# List Voices

> Lists voices visible to the current workspace: voices created in this workspace (cloned or designed), plus the public voices Vivix provides.



## OpenAPI

````yaml streaming-avatar/api-references/openapi.json GET /v1/voices
openapi: 3.1.0
info:
  title: Vivix Streaming Avatar API
  version: 1.0.0
  description: REST endpoints for Streaming Avatar sessions, voices, and characters.
servers:
  - url: https://api.vivix.ai
security:
  - bearerAuth: []
paths:
  /v1/voices:
    get:
      summary: List Voices
      description: >-
        Lists voices visible to the current workspace: voices created in this
        workspace (cloned or designed), plus the public voices Vivix provides.
      operationId: listVoices
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: object
                required:
                  - code
                  - message
                  - data
                properties:
                  code:
                    type: integer
                    description: '`0` on success; any other value is an error code.'
                  message:
                    type: string
                    description: '`success`, or an English error description.'
                  data:
                    type: object
                    properties:
                      voices:
                        type: array
                        description: Visible voices.
                        items:
                          type: object
                          properties:
                            voice_id:
                              type: string
                              description: Voice id (shaped like voice\_…).
                            name:
                              type: string
                              description: Display name.
                            language:
                              type: string
                              description: >-
                                One of `zh` (Chinese), `en` (English), `fr`
                                (French), `de` (German), `ja` (Japanese), `ko`
                                (Korean), `ru` (Russian), `pt` (Portuguese),
                                `th` (Thai), `id` (Indonesian), `vi`
                                (Vietnamese), `it` (Italian), `es` (Spanish),
                                `ms` (Malay), `fil` (Filipino), `ar` (Arabic),
                                or an empty string.
                          required:
                            - voice_id
                            - name
                            - language
                    required:
                      - voices
              example:
                code: 0
                message: success
                data:
                  voices:
                    - voice_id: voice_9f1c2a7b
                      name: Studio Host
                      language: zh
components:
  securitySchemes:
    bearerAuth:
      type: http
      scheme: bearer
      description: Your Vivix API key. Keep it on your server.

````

